h2.a-subtitle Institution Branding

.m-deflist.m-deflist--editable
    dl.m-deflist__dl
        dt
            strong Institution Text

            em Inform users that access to nejm.org is being provided by your institution.

        dd Columbia University

    dl.m-deflist__dl
        dt
            strong Institution Logo

            em
                | If you wish to display your institution&apos;s logo along with the text, upload the logo.

        dd
            img.m-deflist__img(src='http://www.nejm.org/userimages/958194/banner?trick=1500975326912')

    a.a-btn.a-btn--simple.m-deflist__btn(href='/templates/institution-account-branding-edit.php?bannerInstitution=2')
        svg.icon--edit
            use(xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink', xlink:href='#icon--edit')
        |  Edit

